  "implementation": [
    "Identity-authorized enquiry/RFQ history and metadata reads no longer depend on new-work capability switches; active merchant_staff membership and exact participants/recipients remain required.",
    "Only owner cancellation of raw-open RFQs and authorized enquiry/RFQ mark-read paths are available OFF; create/send/select/status/catalogue writes remain gated.",
